  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The curve contain three activated complex as shown below in the curve.In the curve P and Q are the intermediates. The step with the highest activation energy is the rate determining step. Hence, in the given reaction, two intermediates, three activated complexes are involved and step-II is the rate determining step.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d48b06f6-8250-4354-9c77-9a06b43e7302.png\" style=\"width: 378px; height: 196px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p></blockquote>",
